        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrath of the gods knows no bounds. Ancient Hellas is ravaged by disasters: storms, earthquakes, famine. You will lead a team on a journey through the mythical lands of Ancient Greece! Uncover who is behind the cataclysms — and why. Find every angry god, listen, understand, and bring peace. You will fight, make tough choices, and build bridges between worlds. This is a game about unity, redemption, and hope. Heal the ancient land. Hear the voices of Olympus. Weather the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:<br>– A gathering of legendary gods like never before!<br>– A new light rises — Apollo joins the fight!<br>– An epic story of Jason’s battles with the Olympians!<br>– Enchanting music that echoes ancient Greece!<br>– Unique and varied gameplay mechanics in every location!<br>– Dynamic comic-style cutscenes full of action!</p>",
